                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2871027,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "There's also lots of pavement cafes where you can have a coffee and watch tourists from all over the world go by. The oldest buildings in the area are on the main streets, including the city's first apartment store, built in the eighteen eighties, which is still open today. The sheep market is a centre for fashion, and there's a policy of encouraging new young designers. The young fashion competition is open to local young people who are passionate about fashion. This year, they've been asked to design an outfit based on ideas from the music and technology that's part of their everyday life, using both natural and man made fibres.",
